  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, equation is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mfrac></math> ....(i)<br /><br />Differentiating the given equation, we have<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>df</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>dv</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>du</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>dv</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>du</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbs